Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: KolinOS command-line tools
 Small utilities shipped by the KolinOS distribution: kolinos-info (a
 neofetch-style system summary with the KolinOS branding), kolinos-version
 (name, version and codename), apt-kolinos (enable or disable the
 distribution's own APT repository), kolinos-firstboot (the one-time setup
 that runs after the system is installed), and the graphical session helpers
 kolinos-session, kolinos-terminal, kolinos-wallpaper and kolinos-launcher
 (FASE 7).
 .
 It also ships the native C tools cross-compiled from src/ (stage 32):
 kolinos-fetch, the fetch-style summary that reads /etc/os-release,
 /etc/kolinos/version and /etc/kolinos/branding/logo.txt in a single process,
 and kolinos-hw, the hardware report that parses /proc and /sys for CPU,
 memory, storage, thermal and load data. Both are statically linked for
 aarch64, so they work inside proot and on a degraded rootfs without an
 interpreter.

